@startuml ble-overview
title TvApp BLE主要フロー（main @ d87b3bc）

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F7F8FA
  BorderColor #52606D
  ArrowColor #334E68
}

state "環境確認" as EnvironmentCheck
state "権限待ち" as PermissionRequired
state "Bluetooth OFF" as BluetoothOff
state "スキャン停止" as ScanStopped
state "スキャン中" as Scanning
state "接続中" as Connecting
state "接続済み" as Connected
state "切断中" as Disconnecting
state "切断済み" as Disconnected
state "接続失敗" as ConnectionFailed

[*] --> EnvironmentCheck : Activity起動 / ON_RESUME
EnvironmentCheck --> PermissionRequired : スキャン権限なし
EnvironmentCheck --> BluetoothOff : Bluetooth OFF
EnvironmentCheck --> ScanStopped : 権限OK / Bluetooth ON

PermissionRequired --> EnvironmentCheck : 権限結果 / ON_RESUME
BluetoothOff --> EnvironmentCheck : Bluetooth ON後にON_RESUME

ScanStopped --> Scanning : startScan()成功
Scanning --> Scanning : デバイス検出 / 一覧更新
Scanning --> ScanStopped : stopScan()
Scanning --> Connecting : デバイス選択\nスキャン停止後にconnectGatt()

Connecting --> Connected : 接続callback成功
Connecting --> ConnectionFailed : GATTエラー / 15秒timeout
Connected --> Disconnecting : disconnect()\nGATT操作なし
Connected --> Disconnected : remote切断\nGATT_SUCCESS
Connected --> ConnectionFailed : GATT異常切断
Disconnecting --> Disconnected : 切断callback成功 / 5秒timeout
Disconnecting --> ConnectionFailed : 切断例外 / callbackエラー
Disconnected --> Connecting : 別デバイスを選択
ConnectionFailed --> Connecting : 再試行

note right of Connected
  接続成功後にサービス探索を自動開始する。
  接続中の購読・通知受信・コマンド書き込みでは
  BleConnectionStatusはConnectedのまま。
end note

note bottom
  このページは主要ユーザーフローの要約。
  実装ではスキャン、接続、サービス探索、購読、
  コマンド書き込みを独立した状態として保持する。
end note

@enduml

@startuml scan-state
title スキャン状態（BleScanStatus）

skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state Stopped
state Scanning
state PermissionRequired
state BluetoothOff
state Error

[*] --> Stopped : BleScanUiState生成

Stopped --> Scanning : startScan() / Started
Stopped --> PermissionRequired : refreshまたはstart\n権限不足
Stopped --> BluetoothOff : refreshまたはstart\nBluetooth OFF
Stopped --> Error : scanner利用不可 / start例外

Scanning --> Scanning : onScanResult / onBatchScanResults
Scanning --> Stopped : stopScan() / connect()選択
Scanning --> Error : onScanFailed
Scanning --> PermissionRequired : refresh / 権限不足
Scanning --> BluetoothOff : refresh / Bluetooth OFF

PermissionRequired --> Stopped : 権限許可 / Bluetooth ON
PermissionRequired --> PermissionRequired : 権限拒否
PermissionRequired --> BluetoothOff : 権限許可 / Bluetooth OFF

BluetoothOff --> Stopped : Bluetooth ON / ON_RESUME
BluetoothOff --> PermissionRequired : refresh / 権限不足
BluetoothOff --> BluetoothOff : refresh / Bluetooth OFF継続

Error --> Stopped : refresh / 実行可能
Error --> Scanning : startScan()再試行成功
Error --> PermissionRequired : 再確認 / 権限不足
Error --> BluetoothOff : 再確認 / Bluetooth OFF

note right of Scanning
  refreshEnvironmentState()は、権限不足と
  Bluetooth OFFをこの順で優先して判定する。
end note

@enduml

@startuml connection-and-discovery-state
title GATT接続・サービス探索状態

skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state "接続状態 (BleConnectionStatus)" as Connection {
  state Disconnected
  state Connecting
  state Connected
  state Disconnecting
  state Failed

  [*] --> Disconnected
  Disconnected --> Connecting : connect()開始
  Disconnected --> Failed : 権限不足 / Bluetooth OFF\n不正address / 開始失敗
  Disconnected --> Disconnected : disconnect() / GATTなし

  Connecting --> Connected : callback\nGATT_SUCCESS + CONNECTED
  Connecting --> Disconnected : callback\nGATT_SUCCESS + DISCONNECTED
  Connecting --> Failed : connect例外 / GATTエラー\n15秒timeout
  Connecting --> Connecting : 二重connectを無視

  Connected --> Disconnecting : disconnect()\nGATT操作なし
  Connected --> Connected : 二重connectを無視\nまたは操作中のdisconnectを拒否
  Connected --> Disconnected : remote切断 / GATT_SUCCESS
  Connected --> Failed : GATT異常切断 / callbackエラー

  Disconnecting --> Disconnected : callback成功 / 5秒timeout
  Disconnecting --> Failed : disconnect例外 / callbackエラー
  Disconnecting --> Disconnecting : connectを無視

  Failed --> Connecting : connect()再試行
  Failed --> Failed : 再試行の事前条件エラー
}

state "サービス探索状態 (BleServiceDiscoveryStatus)" as Discovery {
  state Idle
  state Discovering
  state Discovered
  state DiscoveryFailed <<failed>>

  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Discovering : 接続成功後にdiscoverServices()
  Discovering --> Discovered : onServicesDiscovered\nGATT_SUCCESS
  Discovering --> DiscoveryFailed : 開始失敗 / callbackエラー\n10秒timeout
  Discovered --> Idle : 接続終了 / 次回connect開始
  DiscoveryFailed --> Idle : 接続終了 / 次回connect開始
}

Connected --> Discovering : 接続成功で自動開始
Disconnected --> Idle : サービス一覧を消去
Failed --> Idle : サービス一覧を消去

@enduml

@startuml subscription-state
title Notification / Indication購読状態（BleSubscriptionStatus）

skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state Idle
state Subscribing
state Subscribed
state Unsubscribing
state Failed

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Subscribing : subscribe()\nlocal通知ON + CCCD write開始
Idle --> Failed : 事前条件または開始失敗
Subscribing --> Subscribed : onDescriptorWrite成功
Subscribing --> Failed : callbackエラー / 10秒timeout

Subscribed --> Subscribed : onCharacteristicChanged\n通知内容を更新
Subscribed --> Unsubscribing : unsubscribe()\nlocal通知OFF + CCCD write開始
Subscribed --> Failed : unsubscribe開始前エラー
Unsubscribing --> Idle : onDescriptorWrite成功
Unsubscribing --> Failed : callbackエラー / 10秒timeout

Failed --> Subscribing : subscribe()再試行
Failed --> Unsubscribing : activeSubscription保持時に再試行

Subscribing --> Idle : 接続終了
Subscribed --> Idle : 接続終了
Unsubscribing --> Idle : 接続終了
Failed --> Idle : 接続終了

note right of Failed
  unsubscribe失敗時はPeripheral側のCCCD状態が
  不明なためactiveSubscriptionを保持する。
  subscribe失敗時はlocal通知をOFFに戻す。
end note

@enduml

@startuml command-write-state
title コマンド書き込み状態（BleCommandWriteStatus）

skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state Idle
state Queued
state Writing
state Succeeded
state Failed

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Queued : enqueueCommandWrite()受付
Succeeded --> Queued : 次のコマンドをenqueue
Failed --> Queued : コマンドを再enqueue
Writing --> Queued : 実行中に追加enqueue

Queued --> Writing : queue先頭をwriteCharacteristic()
Writing --> Succeeded : onCharacteristicWrite\nGATT_SUCCESS
Writing --> Failed : 開始失敗 / callbackエラー\n10秒timeout
Queued --> Succeeded : 追加enqueue後に\n実行中writeが成功
Queued --> Failed : 追加enqueue後に\n実行中writeが失敗

Succeeded --> Writing : queueに次のwriteあり
Failed --> Writing : queueに次のwriteあり

Queued --> Idle : 接続終了
Writing --> Idle : 接続終了
Succeeded --> Idle : 接続終了
Failed --> Idle : 接続終了

note right of Writing
  activeCommandWriteは常に最大1件。
  完了・失敗・timeout後にだけ次のwriteを開始する。
end note

note bottom
  Queuedはキュー全体の静止状態ではなく、enqueue時に通知されるUI状態。
  実行中に追加enqueueすると、active writeを維持したまま
  表示状態がWritingからQueuedへ変わる場合がある。
end note

@enduml
